# S-844 T-964: DotAccess in Call-func position produces a constructor pattern with qualified tag.
# [Result.Ok v] → Call { func: Field(VarRef("Result"), "Ok"), args: [VarRef("v")] }
# Parser accepts this syntax. Variant tags are qualified (Result.Ok, etc.) after S-850.
# The ... arm fires here because the scrutinee is a String "x", not a Result.Ok variant.
[match "x"
    [case [let v] [Result.Ok v] v]
    ...:           "other"]
=== out
String("other")
